  "instance_name": "legal_classification_of_killing",
  "label": "The legal process of determining whether a killing is classified as homicide",
  "description": "The legal classification of killing refers to the legal process of determining whether a killing is classified as homicide, which typically requires the victim to be a human being. In the meme, the implication that killing zombies (non-human entities) is not homicide is used to justify or minimize racially motivated violence. This requires understanding of the legal classification of killing and its application to human life.",
